# Why whitelist style: ignore everything first, so a new secret (.env), dataset or notebook can never leak into the build context by default.
*

# Why: the FastAPI entrypoint (ASGI target main:app).
!main.py

# Why: settings module imported by main.py at startup.
!config.py

# Why: the builder stage installs prod deps from it.
!requirements.txt

# Why: the builder stage installs this hash-pinned lock; requirements.txt stays as its human-edited source.
!requirements.lock

# Why: the trained models the API loads; .keras and .png in models/ stay excluded.
!models/*.joblib

# Why: lookup tables the API reads alongside the models.
!models/lookup_data.json
